~ start
Unknown: [[Hi|Hello|Howdy]], thank you for playing my game.
Unknown: Welcome to the tutorial, i'll show you how the game works.
Unknown: My name is Bob.
Bob: Let us start with movement
Bob: Use WASD or the left joystick to move.
Bob: Try it out!
do wait_for_player_distance(300.0)
Bob: [[Great job!|Awesome!]] Now let's continue.
Bob: Now it's time for how you'll defend yourself.
Bob: You've been given an axe.
Bob: There are two ways to use it for attacking.
Bob: First, by spining it around yourself.
Bob: You can do this by pressing left/right mouse buttons, Q/E or left/right shoulder buttons.
Bob: Try it!
do wait_for_player_spin_attack()
Bob: Great!
Bob: Second way is by throwing it.
Bob: With K/M you aim with the mouse and throw by pressing spacebar.
Bob: Meanwhile on controller/touch you aim with the right joystick and throw by releasing it.
do wait_for_player_throw()
Bob: Well done!
=> END